\nPlease note:\r\n• Custom fondant figures/toppers take 2–3 extra days\r\n• Final design will be shared for your approval before baking\r\n• We recommend confirming at least 5–7 days before your event\r\n\r\nKindly accept the quote and pay the 50% advance to begin crafting your design.',3000.00,'INR','sent','2026-05-29 08:07:52',NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-26 08:07:52','2026-05-26 08:07:52');
